## Problem families

### Bounds for binary constant weight codes
- Maintainers: Andries E. Brouwer
- Home: https://www.win.tue.nl/~aeb/codes/Andw.html
- Upstream terms: No formal licence stated; a public research reference on code bounds.
- Held here: Records store the parameters, the two published bounds, and a quoted fragment of the table row. Brouwer's explicit record codes are not redistributed.
- Requested citation: The page asks for corrections and updates at aeb@cwi.nl and names its own sources: cite A. E. Brouwer, "Bounds for binary constant weight codes", https://www.win.tue.nl/~aeb/codes/Andw.html, together with A. E. Brouwer, J. B. Shearer, N. J. A. Sloane & W. D. Smith, "A new table of constant weight codes", IEEE Trans. Inform. Theory 36 (1990) 1334-1380, and E. Agrell, A. Vardy & K. Zeger, "Upper bounds for constant-weight codes", IEEE Trans. Inform. Theory 46 (2000) 2373-2395, for the entries taken from them.

### Bounds on the minimum distance of linear codes
- Maintainers: Markus Grassl, Andries E. Brouwer
- Home: https://codetables.de/
- Upstream terms: No formal licence stated; a public research reference on code bounds.
- Held here: Records store the code parameters, the two published bounds, and the quoted table cell. No generator matrices or construction descriptions are copied.
- Requested citation: Cite M. Grassl, "Bounds on the minimum distance of linear codes and quantum codes", online at http://www.codetables.de, and credit A. E. Brouwer's tables for the entries derived from them.

